    "items": [
      "Changing `DLC1EncHunterTemplate` 00336F:Dawnguard.esm also needs the six Dawnguard rungs `EncDawnguard01TemplateMelee` 01421F:Dawnguard.esm … `EncDawnguard06TemplateMelee` 014224:Dawnguard.esm (levels 1 · 5 · 9 · 14 · 19 · 25): they reach it through `EncDawnguard00Template` but not for `Stats` (on *Common Dawnguard*). Isran, Gunmar, Vanik and the `…Magic` / `…Missile` templates also keep their own level; Sorine and Florentius keep theirs from `…Missile` and `…Magic`.",
      "The other rows: no other record keeps its own level.",
      "Agmaer, Beleval, Tilde, Vori, Ollrod, Mogrul and `EncDawnguard00Template` carry `Stats` and follow `DLC1EncHunterTemplate`."
    ]
  },
